  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GI-TOC: Political Economy Analysis of Irregular Migration from Africa to Europe 2024-2029</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to enhance the knowledge and evidence base on understanding of human smuggling and trafficking, its criminal context, links to security conflict and instability, as well as its relationship to different drivers of irregular migration. To contribute to stregthen responses to organized crime, corruption and instability and respect for human rights and rule of law and enhance and leverage partnerships for more effective responses to human smuggling and trafficking.</narrative>
  </description>
